  "title": "Buttery Cinnamon Cake",
  "description": "This cinnamon cake will be met with rave reviews from everyone who tries it. Cinnamon does double duty: both in the batter and in a warm syrupy topping.",
  "authors": [
    "Leta Harris"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-05-05T20:47:11-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-06-20T22:42:06-04:00",
