    "14",
    "1 10-inch bundt cake"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dessert"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.75 teaspoon salt",
    "1.3333333730698 cups white sugar",
    "0.66666668653488 cup shortening",
    "1.5 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "3 large eggs",
    "0.66666668653488 cup milk",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.33333331346512 cup water",
    "6 tablespoons butter",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.75 teaspoon ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1nhEnl4eguPa-i-05pt4zK2pXhE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-01a-60f2127b9ae44dd9855afda29aa5d157.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease and lightly flour a 10-inch Bundt pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dJRCDfeVCVEEzkkwQ1h7kJMTAnc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-01b-a4f326e740f14815bc45244fb49718fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the cake: Stir flour, baking powder, cinnamon, and salt together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WFbYpyz_6FGXXzKD245gR7aR2NA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-02-2ab6a55e7c5e4e518905737f36357297.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar, shortening, and vanilla in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vosOmvtdXRYGmkCN-nlesXU96ro=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-03-2c486a3d55664a6d807ef53d9719ff34.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add eggs, one at a time, beating for at least 1 minute after each addition.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9aBegay1NvAMC1myiLK-Bf8jBS4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-04-f0f8d3e20d1a480bb7f2c49680b1d0e5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in flour mixture alternately with milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xulVKkYbZFJQHXaF5ZWbLAVmC7Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-05-27bd2371c9e443f281669f0a671f2035.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour batter into the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ry5RnIGaOpB8NSaZ2inSwvqKe90=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-06-bcefbbaa59724e808abc70c301386073.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of the cake comes out clean, 40 to 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Lc4Kt1dCQUPBzVsL1WSZv_4hmQs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-07-5139e30798f741cf8a765dce6843ad57.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the cake is baking, make the syrup: Combine sugar, water, butter, vanilla, and cinnamon in a saucepan over medium-low heat. Cook and stir until butter melts; keep warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BJpqMgW7w4y7Sg2y9CaOddfVDMk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-08-840cbdeaa777474f8b5947f1366ee8c1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove cake from the oven and let cool in the pan for 10 minutes. Invert warm cake carefully onto a serving plate or cooling rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/taMtkNmOOdbfQpbqJpr99mPaRrU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-09-203ed80e5e224159bb078ffb2a04b736.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a fork to poke holes around the top of the cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2-5YqaDyj2_qOszldYF2S5x-jcM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-10-d697fe0eb1b84954a7f88672c55b7060.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour warm syrup over the top and sides, making sure it goes into the holes. Serve after about 30 minutes, while still warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sBp6Ue-9ADXte7sF1KIHOFPomW8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7540-buttery-cinnamon-cake-DDMFS-step-11-65d3a60b98b047e1a75541922108f0ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7540/step_12.webp"
    }
  ],
